<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard contained a 2,000‑liter mineral oil leak from an NGCP submarine cable off Tabango, Leyte, and recovered 250 kilograms of oil waste, while Japan pledged $27 million for coastal radar and drones to enhance Philippine surveillance. China Coast Guard vessels patrolled waters around the disputed Diaoyu Dao and a Chinese survey ship entered Scarborough Shoal, prompting the Philippines to summon the Chinese ambassador over remarks it deemed threatening. The Philippines also sought additional Indian BrahMos missiles to strengthen its coastal defenses against China. 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNbHpmT3RWQzBNeUVqTlJ6Ukx5eWpFR0dTbmx4RGZ1YkdSTmtzbWRiT01vVXcwZTN0dzZ2Q1l6Q0htT19nYUxSdDNpaTU5SE1td1E0WG9TWHhBQy1oWDVMbi1SbFVUd0w0QzgtQmF3aUtCallvVUVLQm5iaHFGd3BnQnFHd2hkdTNYUURFY1o4bmtfc3Z0ZXFYUS0yZDBLOW1pZERaNGgzSkU3Uk9MMjVrSUJ6alFMZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eurasia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE05YTJabDhlWE5IQ3pNWEkybEdqblp0WDRRd21WcmMwbnY2dzROaHBLblZoT2VQOWFhc1JTTzEtRC1QZzFDWmlRaUlvb0lIaGtaOWQ4eHhqcDJYWmlCYTA5SURIdkZ4Yk0zTnJIcGpfR1JHd000?oc=5&quot;&gt;astig.ph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9CLVkzNlUwUFltY2dUSUFLWGJOTlJ3QkVJTktrT21TTmEzMmJvM1hYeEh6MTMyU2FoZnpodWFRUjU2RHMzT1VQUl9NRnZPajRvdUtJcmdfaWVzM1dXREE?oc=5&quot;&gt;朝日新聞&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE45WVdFbm5oTkNuaEpWMVg5SnV6SVBsbWZ3UU0wUktCYkh5akhKSnhkRl9TVlJNUGJ6NDNzU3ZSNTAxdWtDUENfWE82MDJSWmtxMThXZXpCdTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;ch